Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(motion): honor Circular pass order and protect vault
 entries

Keep the Auto ring order and depth ladder. Start forced vault rings from stock height and keep the cutter inside each ring during entry. Preserve clearance between rings. Expose the shared setting in the Passes tab and through MCP.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3359
